  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/500/title.png\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"><img src=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsketchfab.com%252ffurti_two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1807/822/image_2026-07-20_221457219-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Представляем мод Useless Sword (Бесполезный меч). Этот мод добавляет 76 новых мечей в версию 1.16, 60 новых мечей в 1.15, 59 мечей в 1.14 и 51 меч в 1.12!</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>В качестве основы для мечей используются предметы, которые уже существуют в игре и выпадают из мобов</strong> (установите <a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>, чтобы увидеть все рецепты)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Я француз, и этот мод был создан с помощью Mcreator (Извините за ошибки в английском языке 😅)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Вот список мечей:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/501/image1.png\" width=\"955\" height=\"854\"></p>\n<p><br>Мод Useless Sword совместим с Aquaculture, Create, Alex's Mobs, Druidcraft, Botania, Update Aquatic, Savage and Ravage, Endergetic Expansion и Twilight Forest (необязательная зависимость).<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/502/image2.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"383\"><br><br></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/330/43/uselessswordrecipe.png\" alt=\"upload_2020-12-28_15-54-56.png\" width=\"1117\" height=\"561\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Обзор мода на испанском языке от Max Covs:</strong></span></div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wN2lz60GuSE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><strong>Вы можете добавлять Useless Sword в свои модпаки.</strong><br></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/738/503/image4.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Вы также можете взглянуть на другие мои моды:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"ht